  },
  {
   "kind": "voiceover",
   "t": 15.667,
   "duration": 12.02,
   "text": "Rule one. Use simple words. Replenished becomes full. Prior to becomes before. Commencing becomes starting. The length does not change. But each word is easier to read.",
   "bookmarks": {
    "mark": 18.397,
    "swap": 23.903
   },
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "bookmark",
   "t": 18.383,
   "mark": "mark",
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "bookmark",
   "t": 23.9,
   "mark": "swap",
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "voiceover_end",
   "t": 27.683,
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "voiceover",
   "t": 28.183,
   "duration": 8.965,
   "text": "Rule two. Give the instruction directly. Remove the frame around the instruction, and talk to the reader. The sentence now has thirteen words.",
   "bookmarks": {
    "mark": 31.381,
    "swap": 35.024
   },
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "bookmark",
   "t": 31.367,
   "mark": "mark",
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "bookmark",
   "t": 35.017,
   "mark": "swap",
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "voiceover_end",
   "t": 37.133,
   "issues": [],
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "voiceover",
   "t": 37.633,
   "duration": 11.99,
   "text": "Rule three. Use a concrete verb. The words make sure and is full describe a state. The verb fill names the action. Operation becomes machine. The sentence now has nine words.",
   "bookmarks": {
    "mark": 40.519,
    "swap": 47.631
   },
   "scene": "Ste80"
  },
  {
   "kind": "bookmark",
